WEBVTT

01:36.479 --> 01:39.990
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.110 --> 01:42.039
[Episode 21]

02:00.190 --> 02:00.630
Hello, Mom.

02:00.630 --> 02:01.430
Xingchi!

02:01.950 --> 02:04.350
What have you been doing? Your phone has been off all day.

02:06.070 --> 02:07.310
My phone ran out of battery.

02:07.810 --> 02:09.259
I just charged it. What's wrong?

02:09.789 --> 02:11.450
We were worried about you.

02:12.950 --> 02:14.320
I'm a grown-up now.

02:14.680 --> 02:15.710
You don't have to worry about me.

02:16.079 --> 02:17.040
I'm fine.

02:17.300 --> 02:18.200
Don't worry, Mom.

02:18.310 --> 02:19.230
What do you mean "don't worry"?

02:19.270 --> 02:19.829
Listen to me.

02:19.829 --> 02:21.950
From now on, don't ever...

02:22.670 --> 02:24.040
...Just keep your phone on.

02:24.260 --> 02:26.740
I called you because I wanted to tell you that

02:27.070 --> 02:27.829
your dad

02:27.860 --> 02:29.500
has arranged with Mr. Du

02:29.710 --> 02:31.490
for you to learn bamboo carving from him.

02:31.990 --> 02:32.670
Bamboo carving?

02:32.690 --> 02:34.900
That's an intangible cultural heritage.

02:35.310 --> 02:35.950
Xingchi.

02:36.070 --> 02:36.910
Listen.

02:37.070 --> 02:38.190
Your Uncle Du

02:38.270 --> 02:40.030
is a famous bamboo carving master.

02:40.070 --> 02:41.310
He's doing me a great favor,

02:41.310 --> 02:43.030
being willing to take you as an apprentice.

02:43.070 --> 02:43.350
Right.

02:43.130 --> 02:45.690
[Hang up]

02:43.130 --> 02:45.690
[Mom]

02:43.350 --> 02:44.690
I'm telling you, stop messing around out there.

02:44.730 --> 02:45.870
Just come back home.

02:48.060 --> 02:48.820
What happened?

02:49.400 --> 02:50.610
He hung up, that's what happened.

02:50.710 --> 02:53.110
Try... Try calling him again. It must have been a disconnection.

02:59.720 --> 02:59.970
[Hang up]

02:59.720 --> 02:59.970
[Mom]

03:00.070 --> 03:02.770
[Turn off] [Reboot]

03:04.070 --> 03:06.110
The subscriber you dialed is power off.

03:07.230 --> 03:08.070
He turned off his phone.

03:08.840 --> 03:09.870
Look at him.

03:09.870 --> 03:11.150
How can he be so immature?

03:11.950 --> 03:13.150
Look at Wanghe,

03:13.150 --> 03:14.540
Haikuo, and Fenghua,

03:14.730 --> 03:15.150
right?

03:15.150 --> 03:16.150
They're becoming more and more filial.

03:16.150 --> 03:17.470
And here he is, almost 30,

03:17.490 --> 03:18.530
yet still in his rebellious phase.

03:18.550 --> 03:19.950
Just criticize Xingchi if you want to.

03:19.990 --> 03:20.990
Why do you have to get the other kids involved?

03:20.990 --> 03:21.829
Who should I compare him to

03:21.870 --> 03:22.680
if not them?

03:22.710 --> 03:24.000
You know the saying, to feed without teaching

03:24.000 --> 03:25.079
is the father's fault.

03:25.590 --> 03:27.000
So it's all my fault, you mean?

03:27.540 --> 03:29.470
I shouldn't have let him go to Beijing!

03:40.700 --> 03:46.090
[West Zhongguancun]

03:46.270 --> 03:47.890
This is an express delivery station, you know?

03:47.720 --> 03:51.290
[Fenghua Express]

03:47.940 --> 03:49.370
It's not a soup kitchen.

03:49.400 --> 03:50.520
Why should we provide for your whole family?

03:50.670 --> 03:51.470
Look at your family,

03:51.510 --> 03:52.680
eating and drinking so much.

03:52.890 --> 03:53.960
Who can afford to support you?

03:55.030 --> 03:56.150
I don't want to leave.

03:57.230 --> 04:00.230
I don't want to... I don't want to go.

04:02.950 --> 04:04.490
Fenghua is here.

04:04.630 --> 04:05.630
Sun, what's going on?

04:05.670 --> 04:07.460
Fenghua! You're finally back.

04:07.510 --> 04:07.750
It's alright.

04:07.750 --> 04:08.910
How many times have I told you?

04:08.910 --> 04:09.750
Our station

04:09.750 --> 04:11.190
is just this small courtyard

04:11.230 --> 04:12.230
that can only hold over a dozen people.

04:12.310 --> 04:13.740
We can't afford to support freeloaders.

04:14.370 --> 04:16.089
If He Tianming wants to work here, that's okay.

04:16.110 --> 04:17.820
But bringing his whole family here

04:17.870 --> 04:18.649
is not acceptable.

04:22.480 --> 04:23.260
He Tianming.

04:23.370 --> 04:24.460
If you want to work here,

04:24.500 --> 04:25.680
then work properly.

04:26.290 --> 04:27.510
Find another place to accommodate

04:27.510 --> 04:29.160
your wife, child, and mother.

04:29.450 --> 04:30.680
You can't cause trouble

04:30.680 --> 04:32.200
for the station, you know?

04:33.140 --> 04:35.830
So where do you want our whole family

04:35.909 --> 04:37.550
to live?

04:37.950 --> 04:39.200
Beijing is such a big city.

04:39.350 --> 04:40.070
If you spend a little money,

04:40.070 --> 04:41.480
you can find a place to live, can't you?

04:41.770 --> 04:42.930
If you really can't manage,

04:43.530 --> 04:44.960
go live under a bridge.

04:48.470 --> 04:49.520
Enough!

04:49.909 --> 04:50.750
Why are you all standing here?

04:50.800 --> 04:52.450
Packages have arrived. Hurry up and send them out.

04:52.740 --> 04:53.870
Didn't you hear what Mr. Sun said?

04:53.909 --> 04:55.150
We don't keep idle people here.

04:55.390 --> 04:57.640
He, take them and get those packages sent out quickly.

04:58.900 --> 05:00.390
Auntie, go cook.

05:00.510 --> 05:01.120
Okay.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.340
Let's go.

05:02.380 --> 05:03.200
Let's go.

05:03.710 --> 05:04.970
I'll take the child to cook.

05:05.130 --> 05:05.670
Okay.

05:05.790 --> 05:07.670
It's almost mealtime. Hurry up and go.

05:09.460 --> 05:10.350
Hey, Xia Fenghua.

05:10.380 --> 05:11.340
What's that supposed to mean?

05:12.910 --> 05:13.920
Don't talk out here.

05:14.100 --> 05:15.220
Let's go talk in the office.

05:18.850 --> 05:19.690
Come on, let's talk there.

05:32.980 --> 05:35.010
Have a glass of water first and calm down.

05:37.110 --> 05:39.100
You know we're running a business here, right?

05:39.590 --> 05:41.030
This isn't a charity.

05:41.110 --> 05:42.710
Have you ever seen anyone

05:42.750 --> 05:43.909
bring the whole family along when doing business?

05:45.200 --> 05:47.060
Their family's situation is special.

05:47.230 --> 05:49.390
Besides, He is capable.

05:49.409 --> 05:50.150
He might be capable,

05:50.240 --> 05:51.630
but can he handle the workload of three people?

05:51.670 --> 05:53.470
Do you know there are four people in his family?

05:54.050 --> 05:55.150
How can you support all of them?

05:55.670 --> 05:57.190
But they're not just sitting around.

05:57.190 --> 05:58.670
His mother cooks for the station,

05:58.750 --> 05:59.990
and his wife helps with sorting.

05:59.990 --> 06:01.440
They're all quite busy usually.

06:02.430 --> 06:04.620
Are they your relatives?

06:06.550 --> 06:07.360
No, they're not.

06:08.080 --> 06:10.080
He and I were colleagues before.

06:10.110 --> 06:11.390
We handed out flyers

06:11.430 --> 06:12.570
and sold phone cases together.

06:13.310 --> 06:14.900
I know his family is indigent.

06:15.190 --> 06:16.470
I was just thinking,

06:16.670 --> 06:17.710
since they can offer manpower

06:17.750 --> 06:18.590
and they're not lazy,

06:18.670 --> 06:19.870
why can't we all work together?

06:20.430 --> 06:22.270
Besides, they're really not staying here for free.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.310
Not for free?

06:23.940 --> 06:26.300
You call that little money "not staying for free"?

06:27.210 --> 06:28.210
Remember when

06:28.550 --> 06:30.220
we set up this station together?

06:30.260 --> 06:31.190
How difficult it was!

06:31.220 --> 06:33.130
Why did you have to bring in some old, weak, sick, and disabled people?

06:40.670 --> 06:42.670
Sun, how about this?

06:43.120 --> 06:44.940
Do me a favor and

06:44.950 --> 06:46.130
let them stay for a few more days.

06:46.850 --> 06:47.900
He said

06:47.909 --> 06:49.230
he's looking for a place.

06:49.260 --> 06:50.590
As soon as he finds one, they'll move out immediately.

06:50.610 --> 06:51.750
It has to be today.

06:52.240 --> 06:53.340
They must leave immediately!

06:53.870 --> 06:54.760
Sun.

06:54.790 --> 06:56.159
Xia Fenghua.

06:56.430 --> 06:58.150
Have you lost your mind?

06:58.260 --> 06:59.950
Have you even lifted yourself out of poverty?

07:00.620 --> 07:02.230
Yet you're thinking of helping others?

07:03.200 --> 07:04.670
Are you in any position to do that?

07:04.990 --> 07:05.720
Sun Daqing.

07:07.930 --> 07:09.420
Since you've brought this up,

07:09.880 --> 07:11.270
let's get things straight.

07:12.040 --> 07:14.640
This station was originally contracted by me alone.

07:14.660 --> 07:16.980
I only brought you in because you wanted to join.

07:17.670 --> 07:18.870
Today, without my consent,

07:18.870 --> 07:20.400
you tried to drive my employee away.

07:20.640 --> 07:21.760
You have no right to do that.

07:22.000 --> 07:22.860
For one station,

07:22.900 --> 07:24.140
there's only so much money it can make.

07:24.500 --> 07:25.880
If you give more to others,

07:25.990 --> 07:27.630
there's less left for us to share.

07:27.860 --> 07:29.420
Can't you do this simple math?

07:29.650 --> 07:32.240
Did you buy that self-study diploma?

07:40.880 --> 07:41.750
Cut the crap.

07:42.370 --> 07:43.810
Settle the accounts right away

07:43.840 --> 07:45.070
and leave!

07:45.550 --> 07:47.290
From now on,

07:47.420 --> 07:48.360
I'll run this station myself!

07:48.390 --> 07:49.950
Way to go, Xia Fenghua.

07:50.370 --> 07:51.490
Don't you regret it.

07:51.990 --> 07:53.290
From now on,

07:53.500 --> 07:54.870
let's go

07:54.370 --> 07:57.930
[Sorting Area (Urban Area)]

07:54.870 --> 07:55.950
our separate ways!

07:59.940 --> 08:00.790
Come in.

08:08.790 --> 08:10.790
Fenghua, I'm sorry.

08:11.230 --> 08:12.820
This is my own decision.

08:12.900 --> 08:14.020
It has nothing to do with you.

08:15.270 --> 08:16.670
Sun and I don't get along.

08:17.220 --> 08:18.540
Splitting up was bound to happen sooner or later.

08:21.130 --> 08:21.940
From now on,

08:21.970 --> 08:23.020
we'll run this station ourselves.

08:23.150 --> 08:25.510
The earth keeps spinning, regardless of who's here or not.

08:27.090 --> 08:27.740
What about

08:28.090 --> 08:29.590
the business Mr. Sun brought in?

08:29.810 --> 08:31.250
He took all the business with him.

08:31.790 --> 08:33.059
We'll find new business later.

08:40.620 --> 08:42.130
No matter how much business we lose,

08:42.159 --> 08:43.600
we'll make it up in the future.

08:44.430 --> 08:45.130
But

08:46.200 --> 08:48.430
you have to help me with some of the management work.

08:48.630 --> 08:49.830
We can't afford it now,

08:50.080 --> 08:51.840
so I won't be able to pay you extra.

08:52.120 --> 08:53.110
No need, Fenghua.

08:53.510 --> 08:54.460
We're already extremely grateful

08:54.710 --> 08:56.130
to you for keeping us on.

08:56.470 --> 08:57.840
Don't worry, Fenghua.

08:57.920 --> 08:59.650
My whole family will work hard from now on.

08:59.950 --> 09:01.030
We won't let you regret it.

09:02.950 --> 09:04.030
Alright, get back to work.

09:10.960 --> 09:12.020
This exhibition of ours

09:12.020 --> 09:14.070
provides a detailed introduction to the history of the canal's evolution

09:14.070 --> 09:16.470
through numerous artifacts and images.

09:15.970 --> 09:22.060
[Honghuai Grand Canal Expo]

09:16.710 --> 09:18.710
Please take a closer look.

09:22.390 --> 09:24.390
Well, speaking of the Grand Canal,

09:24.470 --> 09:25.840
we all know that

09:26.160 --> 09:29.260
it's the greatest hydraulic engineering project of ancient times,

09:29.600 --> 09:30.750
bar none.

09:31.930 --> 09:35.080
In fact, starting from the Spring and Autumn and Warring States periods,

09:35.150 --> 09:36.240
up until today,

09:36.240 --> 09:37.900
our country has continuously

09:37.950 --> 09:40.550
been constructing and dredging the Grand Canal.

09:40.590 --> 09:42.030
After the founding of New China,

09:42.030 --> 09:44.270
in 1953 and 1957,

09:44.270 --> 09:47.110
the Jiangyin Lock and Yangliuqing Lock were built,

09:47.150 --> 09:49.420
as well as thousand-ton locks like the Suqian Lock.

09:49.460 --> 09:50.270
After 1959,

09:50.270 --> 09:52.200
to support the South-to-North Water Diversion Project,

09:52.220 --> 09:54.630
the section from Xuzhou to the Yangtze River was expanded as a key project,

09:52.930 --> 09:58.120
[Lively Jiangnan]

09:54.630 --> 09:56.830
which is about 400 kilometers of the canal.

09:57.570 --> 10:00.090
This increased the canal's annual one-way capacity

10:00.270 --> 10:02.250
to nearly 20 million tons.

10:02.990 --> 10:04.150
It also expanded

10:04.190 --> 10:06.630
the irrigated and drained areas along the canal.

10:07.680 --> 10:08.900
This measure

10:08.940 --> 10:10.350
ensured the safety of people's lives and property

10:10.350 --> 10:11.870
along the canal,

10:11.870 --> 10:14.050
as well as the development of agricultural production.

10:14.230 --> 10:16.250
Therefore, this project has achieved

10:16.460 --> 10:18.180
social benefits in various aspects.

10:19.770 --> 10:21.150
However, there's one point

10:21.190 --> 10:22.590
I want to emphasize today.

10:22.920 --> 10:24.190
That is, through this exhibition,

10:24.230 --> 10:25.350
you may have felt that

10:25.380 --> 10:26.550
this rich heritage

10:26.550 --> 10:28.890
left by our ancestors

10:28.950 --> 10:30.030
is still benefiting us descendants

10:29.040 --> 10:31.750
[Footage of the Sunken Ship]

10:30.070 --> 10:32.300
until this day.

10:31.750 --> 10:38.910
[Canal of Plenty]

10:32.990 --> 10:33.910
Therefore,

10:34.310 --> 10:36.230
we should sincerely exclaim that

10:36.230 --> 10:38.750
this is indeed a great project.

10:41.170 --> 10:41.830
Bravo.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.010
Mr. Zhou.

10:48.110 --> 10:49.170
Come and take a look at this.

10:53.280 --> 10:54.190
Come on, check this out.

10:54.990 --> 10:55.760
What is this?

10:56.150 --> 10:56.980
An arrow.

10:57.230 --> 10:58.550
Mr. Chen found this

10:58.590 --> 11:00.070
on the ship. On the side of the ship.

11:00.990 --> 11:02.180
I found it just now.

11:02.630 --> 11:03.550
You know what it proves?

11:03.580 --> 11:04.460
That this ship

11:04.910 --> 11:05.790
was attacked.

11:06.550 --> 11:07.770
Attacked by whom?

11:09.580 --> 11:10.850
How would I know?

11:11.230 --> 11:12.220
We'll have to wait for

11:12.220 --> 11:14.200
further identification by archaeological experts.

11:18.710 --> 11:19.860
If you ask me,

11:20.260 --> 11:21.580
this ship from late Qing dynasty,

11:21.840 --> 11:22.720
which is less than 100 years old,

11:23.320 --> 11:25.050
really doesn't have much archaeological value.

11:25.160 --> 11:26.370
It's been seven years since we started investigating,

11:26.420 --> 11:27.770
and nothing was found.

11:28.560 --> 11:29.910
We don't even know

11:29.950 --> 11:31.230
who the owner of this ship was.

11:31.250 --> 11:32.070
We do know.

11:32.830 --> 11:34.390
The owner was an Italian.

11:35.520 --> 11:37.470
We don't even know his name.

11:37.500 --> 11:39.380
It's not even recorded in the county chronicles.

11:39.620 --> 11:41.530
After the excavation was restarted,

11:41.570 --> 11:43.040
we did get some new information.

11:43.060 --> 11:43.410
Yes.

11:43.440 --> 11:44.110
For example,

11:44.380 --> 11:45.500
besides these, there's also

11:45.550 --> 11:46.560
a compass,

11:46.990 --> 11:47.930
a pocket watch,

11:47.960 --> 11:49.610
a fountain pen, and that

11:49.640 --> 11:51.430
water-damaged notebook.

11:51.870 --> 11:52.710
Chen Rui

11:52.750 --> 11:53.950
has made a significant discovery

11:53.950 --> 11:55.470
out of

11:55.470 --> 11:56.750
the restored photocopy of this notebook.

11:56.750 --> 11:57.560
Is that so?

11:57.770 --> 11:59.680
But now, he's not that sure.

11:59.700 --> 12:01.830
The canal expo is happening at the right time.

12:01.860 --> 12:03.540
I told him to go to Beijing to see the exhibition,

12:03.690 --> 12:06.560
find the expert who was in charge of the excavation back then,

12:06.580 --> 12:07.590
and ask about it.

12:07.670 --> 12:09.550
He'll also take the opportunity to tell him that

12:09.550 --> 12:12.190
the excavation work on the ancient ship has restarted.

12:12.730 --> 12:14.070
That's great.

12:14.560 --> 12:17.160
Maybe these seven years of waiting weren't in vain.

12:18.930 --> 12:20.460
Sure. Sure.

12:22.350 --> 12:23.550
That kind of ship

12:23.570 --> 12:25.420
was actually quite common in the Jiangsu-Zhejiang area

12:25.450 --> 12:26.790
in the Qing Dynasty.

12:26.820 --> 12:29.150
But since there weren't any precious artifacts on the ship,

12:29.180 --> 12:30.990
we returned to Beijing quite soon.

12:31.010 --> 12:32.000
Yes, I understand.

12:32.020 --> 12:34.410
But what was unearthed back then wasn't just some small items.

12:34.440 --> 12:35.670
There was also a notebook.

12:35.680 --> 12:37.420
I made a copy of that notebook,

12:37.450 --> 12:39.050
and I've studied ancient Italian for a few years.

12:39.080 --> 12:40.270
I have some new discoveries.

12:41.890 --> 12:43.060
What new discoveries do you have?

12:43.100 --> 12:45.250
I found out that the owner of that ship was an Italian.

12:45.280 --> 12:46.280
And that notebook

12:46.310 --> 12:47.350
was actually a diary.

12:47.380 --> 12:49.720
It recorded his observations and experiences during his travels.

12:52.650 --> 12:54.110
Actually, in that era,

12:54.740 --> 12:57.240
there were indeed quite a few Westerners coming to China.

12:57.280 --> 12:58.380
The related records

12:58.430 --> 12:59.870
are also abundant.

13:00.040 --> 13:02.190
But if the person's status at that time

13:02.270 --> 13:03.510
wasn't prominent enough,

13:03.550 --> 13:05.230
it actually doesn't have much research value.

13:05.230 --> 13:06.080
Yes, yes, I understand.

13:06.190 --> 13:08.470
From a macro-historical perspective, it might be so.

13:08.470 --> 13:10.070
But there's one coincidence.

13:10.110 --> 13:11.950
There are several surnames of attendants in that notebook,

13:11.980 --> 13:13.920
namely Xie, Zhou, Xia, and Shao.

13:13.940 --> 13:15.070
These coincide with the surnames

13:15.070 --> 13:17.080
of several households in our Flower Street courtyard.

13:17.310 --> 13:18.310
You mean

13:19.080 --> 13:20.910
they are very likely to be

13:20.950 --> 13:22.940
descendants of the shipwreck survivors?

13:22.990 --> 13:24.600
I think that's possible.

13:24.680 --> 13:26.190
So I'm here to ask you

13:26.190 --> 13:27.710
for the original copy of that notebook.

13:27.750 --> 13:29.070
I want to know the ship owner's

13:29.070 --> 13:30.590
real name and identity.

13:32.590 --> 13:34.710
Well, I'll have to go back and ask about that.

13:35.210 --> 13:36.110
Since there were

13:36.110 --> 13:37.470
no valuable cultural relics on that ship,

13:37.550 --> 13:38.830
after we salvaged it,

13:38.830 --> 13:40.470
we put everything in the warehouse.

13:40.960 --> 13:41.670
How about this?

13:41.750 --> 13:43.470
I'll have them look for it again, okay?

13:43.470 --> 13:44.750
Okay, great.

13:44.750 --> 13:45.630
Thank you, Professor Su.

13:45.670 --> 13:46.750
You're welcome. Let's go.

13:46.830 --> 13:47.340
Okay.

13:59.440 --> 14:01.970
♫At moonset cry the crows♫

14:09.380 --> 14:12.770
♫Streaking the frosty sky♫

14:10.270 --> 14:11.030
Busy working?

14:11.860 --> 14:12.990
Haihong, you're back.

14:14.430 --> 14:16.230
The salted duck you like.

14:17.120 --> 14:18.110
I bought it especially for you

14:18.110 --> 14:19.430
when I passed by Nanjing.

14:19.510 --> 14:21.150
You always care about me the most, Haihong.

14:20.840 --> 14:24.450
♫Dimly lit fishing boats♫

14:21.230 --> 14:21.870
Come on.

14:21.870 --> 14:22.830
Come on.

14:22.860 --> 14:23.790
Have some tofu pudding.

14:23.870 --> 14:24.820
Come on.

14:25.080 --> 14:26.640
That table is vacant.

14:27.230 --> 14:28.140
Listen.

14:28.170 --> 14:28.950
Let's eat that

14:28.950 --> 14:30.510
salted duck together tonight.

14:29.080 --> 14:34.350
♫Sadly lie beneath maples♫

14:30.880 --> 14:31.630
I'll also

14:31.630 --> 14:33.390
make a few side dishes and warm up some yellow rice wine.

14:33.390 --> 14:34.270
Let's have a couple of drinks.

14:34.450 --> 14:36.480
You take your time and enjoy it. I need to catch up on sleep.

14:37.080 --> 14:38.400
Yellow rice wine helps with sleep.

14:38.620 --> 14:39.470
How's it been?

14:39.500 --> 14:40.550
Business has been good

14:40.710 --> 14:41.850
these days, right?

14:42.020 --> 14:42.900
It's alright.

14:42.900 --> 14:43.950
It has its ups and downs.

14:44.310 --> 14:45.440
At least we're not losing money.

14:46.390 --> 14:47.430
How about Lao'er?

14:47.430 --> 14:48.790
As for the floating supermarket,

14:47.660 --> 14:51.510
♫Beyond the city wall♫

14:48.790 --> 14:49.910
business has been good lately.

14:50.400 --> 14:51.400
There have been more and more

14:51.430 --> 14:52.510
ships on the river.

14:52.510 --> 14:53.830
He's been busy from morning till night.

14:53.850 --> 14:55.380
He can make several hundred a day.

14:55.290 --> 15:01.140
♫From Temple of Cold Hill♫

14:57.390 --> 14:58.270
That's good.

14:59.150 --> 14:59.970
How about you guys?

15:00.430 --> 15:01.260
How's it been?

15:03.150 --> 15:03.900
Same as usual.

15:04.100 --> 15:05.220
I still feel the same way,

15:06.300 --> 15:07.270
tired.

15:07.010 --> 15:12.920
♫The sound of bells in the midnight♫

15:08.320 --> 15:10.310
Being tired is fine, as long as we can make money.

15:11.220 --> 15:12.830
I said to Maotian that

15:13.060 --> 15:14.110
while we can still work

15:14.150 --> 15:15.070
these couple of years,

15:15.070 --> 15:16.220
we should work harder

15:16.510 --> 15:18.440
and save more money for Fenghua.

15:18.300 --> 15:24.360
♫Bells break the ship-borne roamer's dream♫

15:20.430 --> 15:21.990
Thinking about Fenghua,

15:22.430 --> 15:23.670
a young girl,

15:24.310 --> 15:25.870
struggling alone in Beijing,

15:26.970 --> 15:28.320
while us parents

15:28.430 --> 15:29.980
can't help much,

15:30.810 --> 15:32.420
it really breaks my heart.

15:32.800 --> 15:38.660
♫At moonset cry the crows♫

15:34.430 --> 15:35.980
You're overthinking it.

15:36.330 --> 15:37.920
Wanghe told me

15:38.140 --> 15:39.530
that Fenghua is doing really well

15:39.570 --> 15:40.810
in Beijing.

15:41.150 --> 15:42.620
There are

15:42.480 --> 15:45.300
♫Streaking the frosty sky♫

15:42.780 --> 15:43.830
several dozen people at her station.

15:44.030 --> 15:45.230
They all listen to her and respect her.

15:47.960 --> 15:50.240
Even if she manages hundreds of people, so what?

15:49.560 --> 15:53.160
♫Dimly lit fishing boats♫

15:50.310 --> 15:52.270
Working like a dog and still not making much money.

15:52.430 --> 15:54.150
She can't compare to Wanghe.

15:55.030 --> 15:56.410
They both have their own struggles.

15:57.030 --> 15:58.260
Before, when Wanghe

15:57.120 --> 16:02.240
♫Sadly lie beneath maples♫

15:58.550 --> 15:59.510
was doing ground promotion,

15:59.510 --> 16:00.650
he had to travel from city to city,

16:01.070 --> 16:02.550
not even having time to eat.

16:02.830 --> 16:04.070
Although it's better

16:04.070 --> 16:04.990
now that he's working at the headquarters,

16:05.030 --> 16:06.070
which is a bit more relaxing,

16:07.040 --> 16:08.240
he can't make any commissions.

16:10.190 --> 16:11.410
You win some, you lose some.

16:10.520 --> 16:14.310
♫Beyond the city wall♫

16:11.550 --> 16:13.030
That's life.

16:15.080 --> 16:16.480
You may as well use that time

16:17.370 --> 16:18.890
to think about adult matters.

16:19.710 --> 16:20.590
Adult?

16:21.440 --> 16:22.320
Which adult?

16:25.970 --> 16:26.810
Dad.

16:28.730 --> 16:29.610
You're watching TV?

16:30.850 --> 16:31.790
I'll go upstairs first.

16:32.990 --> 16:33.720
Wait.

16:35.410 --> 16:36.210
What's up?

16:36.430 --> 16:37.190
Well,

16:37.210 --> 16:39.590
Haihong and Yan came to me,

16:39.660 --> 16:40.610
you know?

16:40.820 --> 16:42.580
They said there's a friend

16:42.750 --> 16:44.070
who wants to meet you.

16:46.150 --> 16:48.340
Friend? What kind of friend? From where?

16:48.360 --> 16:49.930
A high school teacher.

16:50.390 --> 16:50.690
High school?

16:50.710 --> 16:51.920
A woman. A woman.

16:51.950 --> 16:53.430
They say she has a nice character...

16:53.430 --> 16:54.350
Hold on. Hold on.

16:54.390 --> 16:55.310
Her appearance...

16:56.670 --> 16:57.740
It's a blind date, isn't it?

16:57.830 --> 16:59.550
Well, that might be their intention.

16:59.550 --> 17:01.510
What do you mean "intention"? It's really... Really not cool.

17:01.550 --> 17:03.150
Alright, forget it.

17:03.150 --> 17:04.190
So... So you're planning to

17:04.190 --> 17:05.349
stay single forever, huh?

17:06.310 --> 17:08.569
Hey, what's wrong with me staying single?

17:09.270 --> 17:10.910
Aren't you single all along as well?

17:13.040 --> 17:14.750
We're different.

17:15.430 --> 17:16.430
Back in those days,

17:16.460 --> 17:19.099
as a single father with a half-grown child,

17:19.490 --> 17:20.319
how could I possibly get married again?

17:20.869 --> 17:21.480
Where?

17:29.630 --> 17:30.870
Dad.

17:32.510 --> 17:34.030
Tell me the truth.

17:34.630 --> 17:36.230
Back then, was it hard to get married again,

17:36.230 --> 17:37.790
or did you not want to?

17:39.530 --> 17:40.890
You see,

17:41.340 --> 17:42.810
you managed to endure the loneliness for me.

17:43.530 --> 17:44.910
Why can't I do the same?

17:44.990 --> 17:46.230
That's not necessary.

17:47.800 --> 17:49.690
Look, the neighbors

17:49.720 --> 17:51.240
have been arranging things for you from all sides.

17:51.900 --> 17:53.230
Even if you're unwilling,

17:53.270 --> 17:54.710
you should at least meet her once.

17:54.810 --> 17:57.240
Otherwise, you'll be disappointing everyone's good intentions.

17:57.740 --> 17:58.830
Don't you agree?

17:58.870 --> 18:00.580
Right. I agree.

18:05.110 --> 18:06.230
You keep watching TV.

18:06.270 --> 18:07.150
I'm going upstairs.

18:12.020 --> 18:13.130
This one, this one.

18:13.140 --> 18:14.990
Look, they're about the same age.

18:15.020 --> 18:16.460
She looks really quiet. How nice.

18:16.500 --> 18:17.540
And this one.

18:17.560 --> 18:19.310
I think this one should also be our focus.

18:19.630 --> 18:20.830
She's really nice.

18:20.850 --> 18:21.630
Is that so?

18:21.630 --> 18:22.930
Her conditions are good.

18:23.320 --> 18:26.100
You're not trying to find a match for Yanlin again, are you?

18:26.630 --> 18:27.710
Boss Xie, take a look.

18:28.030 --> 18:29.070
What do you think of this woman?

18:31.300 --> 18:33.650
Looking like that, she's not going out to film movies, is she?

18:33.690 --> 18:37.250
She's a high school Chinese teacher, an intellectual.

18:37.600 --> 18:38.990
But... But have you

18:38.990 --> 18:40.990
asked for Haikuo's opinion?

18:41.840 --> 18:44.370
He's also grown up, an adult now.

18:45.710 --> 18:47.890
If I ask him, that's a bit...

18:50.530 --> 18:52.690
Why don't we have our son ask him?

18:52.720 --> 18:54.590
Right, right. Let Wanghe ask him.

18:54.610 --> 18:57.170
They're of the same generation, and they're good friends.

18:57.210 --> 18:59.120
They'll definitely speak their minds to each other,

18:59.140 --> 18:59.830
right?

18:59.860 --> 19:01.720
And then we'll know.

19:18.600 --> 19:19.680
Xiaohui didn't come?

19:20.500 --> 19:22.240
She has a class reunion.

19:22.310 --> 19:23.310
I didn't bother to go back either.

19:23.330 --> 19:24.450
Go ahead, what did you want to talk to me about?

19:30.670 --> 19:32.700
What's wrong? Is it so hard to say?

19:33.440 --> 19:34.990
If you can't say it, then don't.

19:44.960 --> 19:47.100
They want to find a partner for your dad.

19:52.150 --> 19:53.350
They wanted to ask for your opinion.

19:53.380 --> 19:54.470
If you don't agree, then...

19:54.470 --> 19:55.150
I agree.

19:56.880 --> 19:58.500
All these years,

19:58.770 --> 20:00.620
my dad has stayed single and struggled alone.

20:00.710 --> 20:01.870
It's not right.

20:02.520 --> 20:04.260
Don't you want your parents to reconcile?

20:04.290 --> 20:05.690
I've tried.

20:05.710 --> 20:06.510
It did't work.

20:07.130 --> 20:08.490
I've already given up.

20:09.680 --> 20:10.740
Last year,

20:10.760 --> 20:12.500
I asked my mom to come home for New Year's.

20:13.470 --> 20:14.870
She had agreed at first,

20:15.270 --> 20:16.870
but a few days before New Year's,

20:16.890 --> 20:18.480
she said there was a role for her.

20:18.520 --> 20:19.610
It was just a cameo.

20:19.630 --> 20:20.540
Only for a few days.

20:26.600 --> 20:28.260
What? Is this what you wanted to see me for?

20:31.070 --> 20:33.010
What do you want for late-night snacks? My treat.

20:33.280 --> 20:34.050
Why?

20:34.070 --> 20:34.980
You feel sorry for me?

20:35.020 --> 20:35.620
No need.

20:35.860 --> 20:37.380
I'm not as fragile as you think.

20:37.410 --> 20:38.980
Fine, I'm the fragile one, okay?

20:39.530 --> 20:41.240
I've been under a lot of mental stress lately.

20:42.220 --> 20:43.710
I urgently need emotional support.

20:43.810 --> 20:44.510
Alright, alright.

20:44.530 --> 20:45.290
Stop acting.

20:45.320 --> 20:46.680
Your pity party won't work on me.

20:54.630 --> 20:55.950
I'm telling the truth.

20:57.520 --> 20:59.470
I'm about to be parachuted

20:59.590 --> 21:00.500
in Haidian.

21:01.590 --> 21:03.900
Besides the competition from Yuntu

21:03.980 --> 21:05.620
and Eat Well,

21:05.820 --> 21:06.920
I also have to deal with

21:06.950 --> 21:08.950
the complex interpersonal relationships in the company.

21:09.530 --> 21:10.970
If I'm only asked to handle business, there's no problem.

21:11.000 --> 21:11.960
I'm confident.

21:12.620 --> 21:14.210
But when it comes to office politics,

21:14.920 --> 21:16.210
I'm still a bit insecure.

21:17.150 --> 21:18.270
When you have time,

21:18.820 --> 21:20.180
read "Comprehensive Mirror in Aid of Governance".

21:21.620 --> 21:22.980
If you want to achieve great things,

21:23.060 --> 21:24.130
don't hold back.

21:24.750 --> 21:27.230
As long as you're sure you are in the right direction,

21:27.250 --> 21:28.570
just push straight through.

21:29.000 --> 21:30.000
If you get stuck,

21:30.040 --> 21:31.610
it means you're not pushing hard enough.

21:31.870 --> 21:33.240
Put in more effort.

21:33.380 --> 21:35.340
No one can take you down on your own battlefield.

21:35.770 --> 21:36.470
Come on.

21:36.630 --> 21:37.430
You can definitely do it.

21:38.800 --> 21:40.040
You have so much confidence in me?

21:41.510 --> 21:42.350
Back then,

21:42.870 --> 21:44.360
during the group-buying war,

21:44.390 --> 21:45.380
you were in Xiamen.

21:45.430 --> 21:46.910
You realized the trend was changing,

21:46.930 --> 21:49.010
and you called your boss overnight,

21:49.080 --> 21:50.620
telling him to shift the strategic focus

21:50.620 --> 21:52.150
from group-buying to food delivery.

21:52.830 --> 21:54.620
If it weren't for that call,

21:54.680 --> 21:57.420
whether Bee would still exist now would be unknown.

21:58.150 --> 22:00.910
So your boss should be very clear

22:00.950 --> 22:02.230
who he should support.

22:03.980 --> 22:04.820
Hope so.

22:09.920 --> 22:10.850
Brother-in-law!

22:10.880 --> 22:12.560
How could they do that?

22:12.580 --> 22:14.940
I was doing well at the Haidian branch,

22:14.970 --> 22:17.240
and suddenly they decided to parachute someone in,

22:17.540 --> 22:20.160
saying it's to assist me. Do they think I'm stupid?

22:20.260 --> 22:21.910
What are they really up to?

22:24.950 --> 22:26.260
You didn't do a good job yourself.

22:26.700 --> 22:27.750
The higher-ups have concerns.

22:27.790 --> 22:29.300
If the higher-ups have concerns, they can bring them up to me.

22:29.330 --> 22:31.010
I never said I wouldn't correct my mistakes.

22:31.040 --> 22:32.210
But now, all of a sudden,

22:32.230 --> 22:33.550
they sent someone to take over our territory.

22:33.580 --> 22:34.350
What's that supposed to mean?

22:34.490 --> 22:36.540
Was all our previous work for nothing?

22:39.000 --> 22:40.270
Do you know anything about Xie Wanghe?

22:40.290 --> 22:41.850
He's just a ground promoter.

22:44.060 --> 22:45.310
Why should I know about him?

22:45.340 --> 22:47.020
During the group-buying war,

22:47.050 --> 22:48.410
Xie Wanghe's achievements were remarkable.

22:48.940 --> 22:50.020
If it weren't for him,

22:51.130 --> 22:52.840
Bee might not even exist today.

22:53.940 --> 22:54.870
When dealing with someone like him,

22:55.300 --> 22:56.690
you absolutely can't confront him head-on.

22:58.390 --> 22:59.310
Otherwise,

23:01.060 --> 23:02.410
you'll only embarrass yourself.

23:02.780 --> 23:03.850
According to what you're saying,

23:03.880 --> 23:05.610
we might as well just hand over Haidian's business

23:05.640 --> 23:06.950
to him and be done with it.

23:06.990 --> 23:08.350
Why even bother discussing it then?

23:10.330 --> 23:11.880
Mr. Qiu, Mr. Xie is here.

23:13.910 --> 23:14.710
Mr. Song.

23:16.020 --> 23:17.720
Sorry to keep you waiting.

23:17.870 --> 23:19.770
It's all right. Here, let me introduce.

23:20.280 --> 23:22.000
This is Xie Wanghe, Mr. Xie.

23:22.320 --> 23:23.230
This is Qiu Lin,

23:23.870 --> 23:25.590
head of the Haidian branch.

23:25.680 --> 23:26.440
Pleased to meet you.

23:28.180 --> 23:29.270
What kind of tea would you like?

23:29.300 --> 23:30.220
No need for tea.

23:30.250 --> 23:31.210
Room temperature water is fine.

23:31.850 --> 23:32.680
How about bottled water?

23:32.720 --> 23:33.430
Alright.

23:33.990 --> 23:34.920
Qiu Lin.

23:36.490 --> 23:37.490
Go get some bottled water.

23:38.630 --> 23:40.830
Mr. Song, we're all quite busy, so let's get straight to the point.

23:40.860 --> 23:42.620
Let's forget about the water, okay?

23:45.490 --> 23:46.530
Okay, no problem.

23:46.730 --> 23:48.090
I'll get to the point then.

23:48.120 --> 23:49.000
Alright then.

23:49.030 --> 23:50.470
Let's sit down and talk.

23:51.510 --> 23:52.390
Qiu Lin.

23:52.940 --> 23:54.140
Offer your seat to Mr. Xie.

23:55.510 --> 23:56.700
Come on.

24:01.230 --> 24:02.330
Mr. Xie, please.

24:07.820 --> 24:08.690
Mr. Song.

24:08.990 --> 24:09.790
Mr. Qiu.

24:11.630 --> 24:12.760
The headquarters is

24:13.120 --> 24:14.840
very dissatisfied with

24:14.870 --> 24:15.940
the work of the Haidian branch.

24:16.700 --> 24:18.510
Do you have any idea how fierce the competition is

24:18.550 --> 24:19.710
in Haidian?

24:19.710 --> 24:21.430
Let Mr. Xie finish first.

24:22.340 --> 24:24.100
For the food delivery industry,

24:25.030 --> 24:26.140
the Beijing market

24:26.710 --> 24:27.640
is extremely important.

24:27.920 --> 24:29.620
And Haidian is the most crucial area.

24:29.930 --> 24:31.640
However, our current

24:31.670 --> 24:33.700
market share in Haidian is less than 30%.

24:33.950 --> 24:35.470
It has even been declining recently.

24:38.790 --> 24:39.750
With shortage of money

24:40.930 --> 24:42.080
and manpower,

24:42.110 --> 24:43.520
under such circumstances,

24:43.540 --> 24:46.290
the fact that we can maintain a market share

24:46.330 --> 24:48.670
of 30% in Haidian is already quite good.

24:49.460 --> 24:51.460
Everyone in the industry knows

24:51.500 --> 24:53.010
that to compete for this market,

24:53.380 --> 24:55.210
every platform is offering subsidies.

24:56.250 --> 24:57.190
Look at Yuntu

24:57.300 --> 24:58.600
and Eat Well.

24:58.900 --> 25:01.340
They've already offered three rounds of subsidies just this year.

25:01.370 --> 25:02.370
What about us?

25:03.060 --> 25:04.540
Since the day I started working here,

25:04.560 --> 25:06.170
we've only offered subsidies once,

25:06.200 --> 25:07.570
and it wasn't even as substantial as the others.

25:09.190 --> 25:11.600
Under such fierce competition,

25:11.810 --> 25:13.460
I still managed to maintain

25:13.620 --> 25:15.210
the market share in Haidian

25:15.230 --> 25:17.240
steady at 30%.

25:17.270 --> 25:19.170
If the head office is still not satisfied,

25:19.630 --> 25:20.920
I'll quit. How about that?

25:20.950 --> 25:21.830
Sure.

25:22.450 --> 25:24.040
I'll write a report to the headquarters,

25:24.080 --> 25:25.110
and you'll just need to sign.

25:26.110 --> 25:27.110
It's not like that, Mr. Xie.

25:28.440 --> 25:29.730
Qiu Lin

25:30.170 --> 25:31.280
is just short-tempered

25:31.310 --> 25:32.560
and speaks a bit harshly.

25:32.590 --> 25:33.580
Please don't take offense.

25:33.870 --> 25:35.350
It's fine. We're all on the same team.

25:35.380 --> 25:36.670
Who's on the same team with you?

25:37.390 --> 25:38.310
Who do you think you are?

25:40.990 --> 25:41.830
Qiu Lin.

25:42.070 --> 25:43.190
Are you done yet?

25:44.000 --> 25:45.710
Do you still want to work here? If not, get lost!

25:49.080 --> 25:49.880
Mr. Qiu.

25:51.590 --> 25:52.710
Two years ago,

25:53.160 --> 25:54.770
during the group-buying war,

25:55.520 --> 25:57.270
all platforms were burning money.

25:57.320 --> 25:59.000
Mr. Meng wanted to do the same in the first place,

26:00.280 --> 26:01.540
but we didn't have enough funds.

26:01.550 --> 26:02.920
Financing wasn't going well either.

26:03.350 --> 26:05.110
In the end, we were forced to

26:05.130 --> 26:07.130
leave Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou, and Shenzhen,

26:07.580 --> 26:10.140
and we had to look for opportunities in second, third, and fourth-tier cities.

26:10.180 --> 26:11.250
Fortunately,

26:12.070 --> 26:14.710
our strategic direction and execution were on point.

26:15.470 --> 26:16.670
In over 70 cities

26:16.680 --> 26:18.330
and more than 1,000 sales points,

26:18.760 --> 26:20.630
we cooperated closely to break through.

26:20.820 --> 26:22.270
In the end, we successfully implemented

26:22.300 --> 26:24.010
the strategy of encircling the cities from the rural areas.

26:24.310 --> 26:26.260
Our survival in that round

26:26.710 --> 26:28.030
wasn't due to funding,

26:28.200 --> 26:31.350
but our determination and courage to fight with our backs against the wall.

26:31.670 --> 26:32.550
Next,

26:33.230 --> 26:36.080
Bee will shift from group-buying to food delivery,

26:36.860 --> 26:38.310
focusing on local life services.

26:38.600 --> 26:40.330
So, Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou, and Shenzhen

26:40.350 --> 26:42.270
are markets we must conquer.

26:43.770 --> 26:44.780
Before I came,

26:45.510 --> 26:47.780
I made a pledge to Mr. Meng that

26:48.630 --> 26:49.710
within a year,

26:49.740 --> 26:51.960
I will increase Bee's market share in Haidian

26:52.000 --> 26:53.360
to 50%.

26:54.870 --> 26:55.670
50%?

26:55.690 --> 26:57.310
That's wishful thinking.

26:58.520 --> 27:00.070
If I don't reach the goal,

27:00.240 --> 27:01.310
I'll resign.

27:01.960 --> 27:03.840
Then you'll definitely have to resign.

27:07.000 --> 27:07.920
However,

27:09.750 --> 27:12.180
I'll take the responsible parties

27:12.210 --> 27:13.220
with me when I go.

27:22.680 --> 27:24.330
Dear passengers.

27:24.350 --> 27:26.250
For your safety and the safety of others,

27:26.270 --> 27:30.030
please do not bring flammable, explosive, toxic, or dangerous items,

27:30.070 --> 27:33.410
or oversized and overweight items into the station or on the train.

27:33.440 --> 27:34.880
Please cooperate with the security check.

27:34.910 --> 27:35.430
Sir.

27:35.430 --> 27:36.920
Thank you for your cooperation.

27:37.570 --> 27:39.600
How much does a welder make per month?

27:39.830 --> 27:41.350
That depends on your skill level.

27:42.970 --> 27:43.980
I...

27:44.340 --> 27:46.100
I used to do car repairs,

27:46.160 --> 27:47.290
and I can weld too.

27:47.770 --> 27:48.770
Do you have a certificate?

27:49.760 --> 27:50.970
Certificate...

27:51.310 --> 27:52.570
That's easy.

27:52.860 --> 27:54.370
He can make one himself.

27:55.340 --> 27:56.440
Officer Xia.

27:56.830 --> 27:58.110
I've already changed my line of work.

27:59.030 --> 28:00.120
Are you sure?

28:00.200 --> 28:01.300
I am.

28:01.330 --> 28:02.890
Prison food isn't good.

28:02.910 --> 28:03.770
I've got the munchies.

28:04.050 --> 28:05.380
A bowl of noodles would suffice.

28:14.140 --> 28:15.390
Everything in Beijing is good,

28:16.780 --> 28:17.980
but not the noodles.

28:18.290 --> 28:19.610
Then why do you seem to enjoy them?

28:20.190 --> 28:21.300
Where are you from again?

28:21.750 --> 28:23.200
I'm from Honghuai, Jiangsu Province.

28:23.790 --> 28:25.430
It's a small city by the canal.

28:26.450 --> 28:27.760
How long have you been in Beijing?

28:27.870 --> 28:29.280
I came here in 2008. You know that.

28:29.420 --> 28:30.300
Did you come by yourself?

28:31.490 --> 28:33.520
With those buddies. We came together.

28:33.560 --> 28:33.990
Yeah, right.

28:34.010 --> 28:34.970
Where are they now?

28:36.360 --> 28:37.530
Officer Xia.

28:38.510 --> 28:39.900
Are you taking a census?

28:39.940 --> 28:41.700
For someone like you who disrupts social stability,

28:41.720 --> 28:43.600
it's necessary to check thoroughly. No problem with that.

28:46.110 --> 28:48.140
I've done legitimate businesses before.

28:48.580 --> 28:50.660
But they all failed, didn't they? I've already confessed.

28:52.310 --> 28:53.440
Then do you know

28:53.470 --> 28:54.500
why you failed?

28:54.530 --> 28:55.750
I was just unlucky.

28:56.600 --> 28:58.750
It's so hard to make a living without a diploma nowadays.

29:01.820 --> 29:03.150
How much can you really make,

29:03.630 --> 29:04.790
selling fake IDs?

29:05.790 --> 29:07.610
If you hadn't caught me, I'd be making quite a bit.

29:07.910 --> 29:09.520
I could make tens of thousands a month.

29:10.730 --> 29:11.610
Then why don't you sell drugs?

29:11.660 --> 29:12.740
That makes even more money.

29:14.710 --> 29:17.030
Hey, Officer Xia, what do you mean by that?

29:17.670 --> 29:19.030
Even if I had the desire, I don't have the guts.

29:19.110 --> 29:20.670
You shouldn't even have that desire.

29:21.870 --> 29:23.400
Work hard and honestly in Beijing,

29:23.430 --> 29:24.840
and opportunities will come your way.

29:28.020 --> 29:29.720
What opportunities could someone like me have?

29:35.240 --> 29:36.370
Do you know

29:37.470 --> 29:38.660
how much a food delivery rider

29:38.910 --> 29:40.000
makes in a month?

29:41.770 --> 29:42.750
How much?

29:43.030 --> 29:45.220
I didn't know before, but I've asked around.

29:45.240 --> 29:46.670
When business is good, they can make 7,000 to 8,000 yuan a month.

29:46.670 --> 29:47.830
It's even possible to make over ten thousand.

29:48.130 --> 29:49.180
Really?

29:49.200 --> 29:50.050
Of course.

29:50.070 --> 29:51.300
But it's hard work.

29:51.340 --> 29:52.780
Especially when the weather is bad.

29:52.800 --> 29:54.820
Even when there's strong wind, heavy rain, or heavy snow,

29:55.020 --> 29:56.310
they still have to work day and night.

29:57.080 --> 29:58.760
When they get busy, they don't even have time to go to the toilet.

29:59.090 --> 30:01.150
Isn't that what we're out here for? To make money?

30:01.150 --> 30:02.590
Who's afraid of hard work?

30:03.530 --> 30:04.460
Are you interested?

30:05.270 --> 30:06.820
If you're interested, I can hook you up.

30:06.850 --> 30:08.750
There's a food delivery station in our area.

30:08.790 --> 30:09.900
Mentioning my name will help.

30:11.270 --> 30:12.280
Xingchi.

30:12.300 --> 30:14.230
Well, I've looked into your background.

30:14.410 --> 30:17.120
You have records of acts of bravery from both last year and the year before.

30:17.450 --> 30:18.980
You're quite a righteous guy.

30:19.010 --> 30:20.050
Your heart's also in the right place.

30:21.490 --> 30:23.310
Don't ever go down a path of no return.

30:24.920 --> 30:26.000
Alright, eat up.

30:27.770 --> 30:28.950
Don't just sit there.

30:36.310 --> 30:37.550
Here, bubble tea.

30:37.810 --> 30:38.650
What about yours?

30:39.550 --> 30:40.990
Jiang Xiaohui, Zhou Haikuo.

30:41.010 --> 30:42.210
Visiting each other during work hours.

30:42.240 --> 30:43.310
Each of you will be deducted three points.

30:43.830 --> 30:45.380
I'm... I'm sorry, team leader.

30:45.410 --> 30:47.010
I was just delivering bubble tea to him.

30:47.040 --> 30:48.040
I'll get back to work right away.

30:48.060 --> 30:49.180
Don't just say sorry.

30:49.220 --> 30:50.660
Is it fun to keep doing this?

30:50.680 --> 30:52.040
I know you two are close,

30:52.070 --> 30:53.760
but you can't be lovey-dovey all day.

30:53.780 --> 30:55.030
This is a workplace.

30:55.100 --> 30:56.000
If you want to date,

30:56.020 --> 30:56.870
there's a park downstairs.

30:56.990 --> 30:57.390
Why don't you go there?

30:57.430 --> 30:59.080
Is this any of your business?

30:59.160 --> 31:00.880
What does it have to do with you?

31:00.900 --> 31:02.570
You said it yourself that this is a workplace.

31:02.670 --> 31:03.870
It's not a prison.

31:03.890 --> 31:05.560
We're not convicts.

31:06.240 --> 31:07.390
What's with your attitude?

31:07.420 --> 31:08.630
Openly violating company rules.

31:08.630 --> 31:09.990
Zhou Haikuo, you think you're in the right?

31:09.990 --> 31:11.640
What? What's wrong with my attitude?

31:11.700 --> 31:13.150
You're acting like you've got some special authority.

31:13.170 --> 31:14.440
You like deducting points, huh?

31:14.500 --> 31:15.100
Go ahead, deduct all my points.

31:15.150 --> 31:15.670
Let's go. Let's go.

31:15.670 --> 31:17.140
If you're so tough, fire me!

31:17.680 --> 31:18.390
You...

31:18.420 --> 31:19.510
Hey.

31:20.000 --> 31:21.070
What are you doing?

31:21.240 --> 31:22.840
You asked me to go to the park, didn't you?

31:22.880 --> 31:24.040
I'm going to drink bubble tea there.

31:24.800 --> 31:26.220
Let's go, Haikuo.

31:26.260 --> 31:27.790
If you've got the guts, don't come back!

31:29.210 --> 31:30.540
What are you looking at?

31:30.810 --> 31:31.990
Too much free time, huh?

31:32.040 --> 31:33.170
Each of you, three points deducted!

31:33.190 --> 31:34.330
Get back to work now!

31:38.220 --> 31:39.620
-Mr. Xie.
-Bye-bye, Mr. Xie.

31:39.750 --> 31:40.310
Bye-bye.

31:46.390 --> 31:47.110
Mr. Xie.

31:47.590 --> 31:48.380
Mr. Xie.

31:49.350 --> 31:51.110
Li, what's wrong?

32:02.100 --> 32:03.020
There's something I want to tell you.

32:03.440 --> 32:04.950
Maybe I'm overthinking it.

32:04.970 --> 32:05.850
This afternoon,

32:05.880 --> 32:08.440
I overheard Mr. Qiu chatting with some other delivery riders.

32:08.460 --> 32:10.130
I didn't pay attention at first.

32:10.260 --> 32:11.030
But then,

32:11.030 --> 32:12.380
as I kept listening,

32:12.430 --> 32:13.640
he started encouraging them

32:13.670 --> 32:14.860
to jump ship to Yuntu.

32:14.870 --> 32:15.440
What?

32:18.240 --> 32:20.260
At first, I also thought I had misheard.

32:20.280 --> 32:22.240
Later, I asked an employee about it.

32:22.260 --> 32:23.300
It turns out to be true.

32:23.790 --> 32:26.480
He said we can't compete with Yuntu,

32:26.510 --> 32:28.030
and that if they could work well at Yuntu,

32:28.050 --> 32:29.730
they could get company shares.

32:31.520 --> 32:32.890
What should we do, Mr. Xie?

32:33.030 --> 32:34.790
Don't do anything for now.

32:35.020 --> 32:36.620
Let's observe secretly for a while.

32:37.610 --> 32:38.490
Li.

32:39.200 --> 32:40.770
We are the only ones

32:40.800 --> 32:41.850
coming from the headquarters.

32:42.110 --> 32:43.350
I'm counting on you.

32:45.350 --> 32:46.200
Understood,

32:47.910 --> 32:48.930
Mr. Xie.

32:49.220 --> 32:50.230
In this company,

32:50.230 --> 32:51.500
from top to bottom,

32:51.500 --> 32:52.910
they're all Mr. Qiu's men.

32:53.260 --> 32:54.710
You've been parachuted in

32:54.730 --> 32:56.120
with just me as your assistant.

32:57.710 --> 32:59.230
Although Mr. Meng supports you,

32:59.880 --> 33:01.060
to get things done,

33:01.080 --> 33:02.030
the most important thing

33:02.070 --> 33:03.820
is to have your own team.

33:05.100 --> 33:06.050
I understand.

33:06.780 --> 33:07.980
When I'm not around,

33:08.380 --> 33:09.750
keep an eye on them for me.

33:10.260 --> 33:11.310
Leave the rest to me.

33:11.330 --> 33:12.000
Okay.

33:12.200 --> 33:12.840
Go ahead.

33:27.710 --> 33:28.590
Mr. Xie.

33:29.000 --> 33:29.980
In this company,

33:30.030 --> 33:31.310
from top to bottom,

33:31.310 --> 33:32.970
they're all Mr. Qiu's men.

33:33.070 --> 33:34.480
You've been parachuted in

33:34.490 --> 33:35.810
with just me as your assistant.

33:37.490 --> 33:39.150
Although Mr. Meng supports you,

33:39.810 --> 33:40.890
to get things done,

33:40.910 --> 33:41.880
the most important thing

33:41.910 --> 33:43.590
is to have your own team.

33:53.940 --> 33:54.850
Haikuo.

33:55.460 --> 33:56.410
What do you want to eat?

33:58.730 --> 33:59.400
Up to you.

33:59.860 --> 34:00.360
Let's go.

34:04.920 --> 34:07.830
You shouldn't have talked back to him today.

34:08.179 --> 34:09.409
That guy is really sneaky.

34:09.440 --> 34:11.170
He'll definitely cause trouble for you in the future.

34:11.230 --> 34:12.699
I'm just a programmer.

34:12.719 --> 34:14.100
As long as I do my job well,

34:14.130 --> 34:15.500
I'm not afraid of those things.

34:16.110 --> 34:17.860
But I just think it's unnecessary.

34:19.239 --> 34:20.380
When you can't bear it anymore,

34:20.409 --> 34:21.730
there's no need to endure further.

34:21.750 --> 34:22.469
People like him

34:22.500 --> 34:24.739
should be given a direct, hard blow.

34:24.969 --> 34:26.719
Otherwise, he'll get more and more out of line.

34:26.750 --> 34:28.730
When he first joined the company,

34:28.889 --> 34:31.000
he couldn't even figure out how to partition a hard drive.

34:31.020 --> 34:32.230
We all helped him.

34:32.270 --> 34:33.139
But what happened?

34:33.480 --> 34:34.949
Later, by means of sweet talk

34:34.980 --> 34:35.790
and his ability to tattle,

34:35.800 --> 34:37.290
he worked all his way up and became a team leader.

34:37.330 --> 34:38.429
On his first day as team leader,

34:38.460 --> 34:40.550
he fired a colleague who had helped him before.

34:41.679 --> 34:42.659
In this kind of company,

34:42.699 --> 34:44.989
work ability isn't the top priority to begin with.

34:46.260 --> 34:47.270
So,

34:47.520 --> 34:48.560
I don't want to work here anymore.

34:50.350 --> 34:52.210
Actually, I've wanted to quit for a long time.

34:54.070 --> 34:56.290
What's gotten into you?

34:56.320 --> 34:57.520
My roommate

34:57.540 --> 34:59.380
has been sending resumes everywhere since she quit.

34:59.410 --> 35:01.130
It's been about half a year now,

35:01.160 --> 35:02.600
and she's only had one interview.

35:02.630 --> 35:03.700
She didn't even get the chance to say anything

35:03.700 --> 35:04.950
before they said "Thank you" to her.

35:05.650 --> 35:06.290
So,

35:06.320 --> 35:07.680
she's still stuck at home.

35:08.940 --> 35:10.260
With my abilities,

35:10.940 --> 35:12.780
finding a job shouldn't be too difficult, right?

35:12.800 --> 35:14.350
But it's very stable here,

35:14.390 --> 35:15.580
and the work pressure is low.

35:15.630 --> 35:17.740
I just feel it's too stable.

35:17.770 --> 35:18.530
It's really boring.

35:18.550 --> 35:20.300
I can't get excited about anything I do.

35:20.330 --> 35:22.450
The work is also simple, and there's no challenge.

35:22.850 --> 35:25.080
My brain is almost rusted.

35:45.350 --> 35:46.670
Why are you here?

35:46.930 --> 35:48.540
Why are you back so late?

35:49.300 --> 35:50.600
I had something to do.

35:50.960 --> 35:52.270
What could you possibly have to do?

36:03.070 --> 36:04.300
Why is it so messy here?

36:06.470 --> 36:07.380
Have something to eat.

36:08.620 --> 36:09.430
I've eaten.

36:09.750 --> 36:10.580
What did you eat?

36:11.540 --> 36:12.390
Fried Sauce Noodles.

36:13.970 --> 36:15.050
Then I'll eat alone.

36:41.030 --> 36:43.190
How often do you wash your socks?

36:44.070 --> 36:45.020
What?

36:45.340 --> 36:46.460
Are you offering to wash them for me?

36:46.500 --> 36:47.570
If you don't want to wash them,

36:47.600 --> 36:49.360
you can pile them up and wash them all together later.

36:49.380 --> 36:50.350
It also saves water.

36:50.370 --> 36:51.810
That's what I did in college.

36:54.750 --> 36:56.370
What's wrong with you?

36:57.030 --> 36:59.760
Don't you know biological weapons are against the international law?

37:02.910 --> 37:03.790
Spit it out.

37:06.340 --> 37:07.550
What do you want from me?

37:07.580 --> 37:09.560
Can't I just come to see you without a reason?

37:09.730 --> 37:11.600
Haikuo may come to see me without a reason,

37:12.240 --> 37:13.350
but you...

37:25.940 --> 37:27.060
Our company

37:28.480 --> 37:29.930
has a branch in Haidian.

37:30.610 --> 37:32.010
I'm being parachuted there.

37:32.410 --> 37:33.650
I'm planning to make a big splash.

37:36.720 --> 37:38.010
That's great.

37:38.620 --> 37:39.680
Congratulations.

37:40.570 --> 37:41.970
I want you to come with me.

37:42.120 --> 37:43.610
I've never worked in food delivery before.

37:43.640 --> 37:44.720
I'm not interested.

37:47.030 --> 37:47.950
If you've never done it,

37:48.000 --> 37:49.670
how do you know you're not interested?

37:49.870 --> 37:51.430
When Fenghua was busy before,

37:51.430 --> 37:53.110
I went to help out for a couple of days.

37:53.570 --> 37:54.360
It was boring.

38:01.810 --> 38:04.300
Food delivery and express delivery are two different industries.

38:04.320 --> 38:05.520
They're completely different.

38:06.230 --> 38:07.480
What's the difference?

38:07.910 --> 38:10.070
Isn't it just delivering from one point to another?

38:10.100 --> 38:11.110
You're wrong.

38:12.220 --> 38:13.710
China's food delivery industry

38:13.870 --> 38:15.270
is a market worth trillions.

38:15.460 --> 38:18.010
In the future, it will employ tens of millions of people.

38:19.700 --> 38:21.060
Isn't that great?

38:21.460 --> 38:22.660
Just work hard.

38:23.130 --> 38:24.090
I wish you prosperity and wealth.

38:28.540 --> 38:29.810
I'm being parachuted

38:30.390 --> 38:31.660
in Haidian.

38:31.700 --> 38:33.090
No one respects me.

38:33.390 --> 38:35.150
I need my own team.

38:35.540 --> 38:37.570
You have money. Just hire your own team.

38:37.600 --> 38:38.800
It's a big company.

38:38.830 --> 38:41.340
Isn't everyone desperate to get into cutting-edge industries?

38:41.770 --> 38:42.500
Hey.

38:43.020 --> 38:44.930
Why are you so unwilling to help me?

38:44.960 --> 38:46.360
Do you have any concerns?

38:49.930 --> 38:51.570
If you have concerns, just say it.

38:51.940 --> 38:53.660
There's nothing we can't talk about, right?

38:55.270 --> 38:56.150
It's not like that.

38:58.990 --> 39:00.870
I'm just worried I'll hold you back.

39:01.020 --> 39:01.950
I'm telling you,

39:01.970 --> 39:02.660
you won't.

39:02.950 --> 39:04.310
It's not like you lack ability.

39:04.330 --> 39:06.210
You just didn't choose the right industry.

39:07.370 --> 39:08.660
Think it over carefully.

39:08.680 --> 39:09.830
Take your time. I'm in no hurry.

39:18.060 --> 39:18.670
Chen Rui.

39:19.410 --> 39:19.880
Wanghe.

39:19.880 --> 39:21.150
I saw Siyi.

39:22.370 --> 39:23.340
For real?

39:23.700 --> 39:24.460
Where are you?

39:24.760 --> 39:25.750
Houhai Bar Street.

39:26.210 --> 39:26.730
Okay.

39:26.760 --> 39:27.800
We'll be right there.

39:27.870 --> 39:28.720
It was Chen Rui.

39:28.730 --> 39:29.860
He said he saw Siyi.

39:29.900 --> 39:30.490
Let's go.

39:47.230 --> 39:47.910
Chen Rui.

39:50.940 --> 39:51.490
Where is she?

39:51.510 --> 39:52.120
She's gone.

39:52.710 --> 39:53.630
Where did she go?

39:54.760 --> 39:55.640
Tell me!

39:55.660 --> 39:56.540
I don't know.

39:58.670 --> 40:01.490
The boss said she did perform here before.

40:08.650 --> 40:10.130
That girl is pretty good.

40:10.220 --> 40:11.000
She has a great voice,

40:11.070 --> 40:12.510
and she's beautiful.

40:11.670 --> 40:14.740
♫Far away, so far away♫

40:12.530 --> 40:14.150
She just didn't talk much.

40:14.250 --> 40:15.640
Sometimes customers would ask her to drink with them,

40:15.670 --> 40:16.840
but she never agreed.

40:15.780 --> 40:19.120
♫The hometown I can never return to♫

40:17.180 --> 40:18.170
After every performance,

40:18.270 --> 40:19.480
she'd take her salary and leave.

40:19.920 --> 40:21.220
Do you know where she went?

40:20.390 --> 40:22.830
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

40:21.250 --> 40:21.870
She didn't tell me.

40:21.870 --> 40:23.790
She sang here for about two months.

40:23.600 --> 40:28.040
♫Listening to the river flow♫

40:23.830 --> 40:24.500
The last time,

40:25.060 --> 40:26.380
she said she was going on a long trip.

40:26.670 --> 40:28.180
I offered her a raise, but she wouldn't take it.

40:28.250 --> 40:29.360
When was that?

40:29.380 --> 40:30.170
Last month.

40:29.760 --> 40:32.660
♫Hometown, oh hometown♫

40:30.210 --> 40:31.380
Mid-last month.

40:31.420 --> 40:32.260
Well,

40:32.290 --> 40:33.270
I need to get back to work.

40:33.290 --> 40:34.440
You guys enjoy yourselves.

40:33.870 --> 40:37.150
♫Now a distant place I can't go back to♫

40:35.610 --> 40:36.580
Thank you.

40:38.330 --> 40:40.640
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

40:41.500 --> 40:45.610
♫Listening as time drifts by♫

40:45.270 --> 40:46.150
Siyi

40:46.490 --> 40:50.950
♫The sunsets in the city♫

40:47.200 --> 40:49.310
sang here for over two months.

40:49.890 --> 40:51.860
I passed by here every day,

40:51.670 --> 40:54.910
♫Hold no poetry, no distant dreams♫

40:54.020 --> 40:55.860
yet I never ran into her.

40:55.910 --> 40:59.500
♫Walking through a world like a song♫

41:00.690 --> 41:04.120
♫From oblivion to oblivion♫

41:03.530 --> 41:05.000
It's not our fault

41:04.900 --> 41:08.180
♫The love that passed through those remaining years♫

41:05.070 --> 41:06.260
she never contacted us.

41:06.300 --> 41:07.330
It's my fault.

41:08.600 --> 41:10.180
It's my fault.

41:09.840 --> 41:12.610
♫Without complaints or piano music♫

41:10.360 --> 41:11.610
If I...

41:13.910 --> 41:17.000
♫The coolness after the gentle breeze♫

41:14.700 --> 41:16.900
If I hadn't waved my hand

41:17.870 --> 41:21.950
♫I'm destined to be like you♫

41:20.600 --> 41:22.280
and hadn't shouted,

41:23.860 --> 41:25.920
Siwei wouldn't have jumped.

41:25.940 --> 41:28.240
I'm sure Siyi doesn't see it that way.

41:28.440 --> 41:29.730
Then how does she see it?

41:29.760 --> 41:31.400
Tell me how she sees it.

41:32.600 --> 41:34.490
After all these years,

41:34.750 --> 41:37.890
why couldn't she just contact us?

41:37.920 --> 41:39.240
Why?

41:40.100 --> 41:42.070
Siyi takes things to heart.

41:40.650 --> 41:43.690
♫Hometown, oh hometown♫

41:42.230 --> 41:44.720
She's worried she wouldn't be able to repay our favors.

41:44.750 --> 41:46.860
We never asked her to repay us.

41:45.010 --> 41:47.870
♫Now a distant place I can't go back to♫

41:48.370 --> 41:49.880
We're all family.

41:49.090 --> 41:51.610
♫Sitting quietly in the city♫

41:49.910 --> 41:51.550
Who asked her to repay anything?

41:51.580 --> 41:52.600
What's with that shouting?

41:52.400 --> 41:56.740
